    {
      "id": "of7z8xmfDD0G2-h1xSPgU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9502.80012948172,
      "y": -190.89846147809658,
      "width": 1117.115234375,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1693158726,
      "version": 1221,
      "versionNonce": 1238174342,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791566347495,
      "created": 1791538615136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Delta (Delta Lake) ek open-source storage layer hai jo in files ke upar aati hai aur data ko\nParquet format mein store karti hai, saath hi ACID transactions (reliability), time travel\n(purana data dekhna), aur high performance support karti hai.\n\nManaged Delta format ka matlab hai ki aapka data Databricks ke default storage\nlocation par ek secure, high-performance aur reliable Delta Lake table ke roop mein save\nhai, jise Databricks khud poori tarah manage kar raha hai.   ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gUjNv1_ejSSIogeD3R9sA",
      "originalText": "Delta (Delta Lake) ek open-source storage layer hai jo in files ke upar aati hai aur data ko Parquet format mein store karti hai, saath hi ACID transactions (reliability), time travel (purana data dekhna), aur high performance support karti hai.\n\nManaged Delta format ka matlab hai ki aapka data Databricks ke default storage location par ek secure, high-performance aur reliable Delta Lake table ke roop mein save hai, jise Databricks khud poori tarah manage kar raha hai.   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
