      "created": 1791572423923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "dbt run karte hi :\"target\" folder create ho\njata hai\n\nJab aapke SQL models mein Jinja code hota hai\n(jaise {{ source(...) }}), toh dbt \"dbt run\"\nchalane par us Jinja code ko ek final, pure\nSQL query mein badal deta hai. \nleft screenshot mein jo\ntarget/compiled/.../bronze/ folder dikh raha\nhai, wahan wahi fully compiled pure SQL files\nsave hoti hain jo asli mein Databricks par\nrun hoti hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "dbt run karte hi :\"target\" folder create ho jata hai\n\nJab aapke SQL models mein Jinja code hota hai (jaise {{ source(...) }}), toh dbt \"dbt run\" chalane par us Jinja code ko ek final, pure SQL query mein badal deta hai. \nleft screenshot mein jo target/compiled/.../bronze/ folder dikh raha hai, wahan wahi fully compiled pure SQL files save hoti hain jo asli mein Databricks par run hoti hain.",
